scenario: A bear enters the tracking perimeter
id: arch3.bear-enters
kind: nominal
version: 1.0
status: in use
goal: A bear is detected inside the tracking perimeter: predator defense takes over and the drone follows the bear.
description: 3 - Centralized orchestrator. One moment of the mission; what leads there is in its preconditions.
author: MBSE Shepherd, Part 3
date: 2026-11-04
tags: part3, architecture 3
given: arch3.mission-start

phase Predator response

  step bear: pasture sends Predator Detected inside tracking perimeter
    note: Tracking request: the predator takes priority, the orchestrator dispatches the orders.
    then soi.orch is Predator tracking
    then soi.zp is Path Standby
    then soi.sm is Deactivated
    then soi.trk is Tracking Target
    then soi.ap is Following Predator
    then message Predator Alert
